             "MIT - same as agent-skills")
  Project:   https://github.com/addyosmani/agent-skills
  Author:    Addy Osmani
  License:   MIT
  Changes:   Derived, not copied. Rewritten as a MonoMind template: all
             subject matter replaced with bracketed placeholder slots, the
             upstream artwork and diagrams dropped and replaced with an
             original placeholder drawing, the colophon and identity line
             added, and the traps documented in comments and in
             references/slide-patterns-framed-deck.md. The stylesheet and the
             navigation script are kept as they are, which is the point of a
