Slides AI Plugin onboarding deck — previews/slide-design.html
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
The preview behind option five is proyecto26's own onboarding deck, rebranded.
The slide architecture, GSAP choreography, and animation work are theirs; the
palette, typography, mark, and copy are MonoMind's.

  Upstream:  https://proyecto26.com/slides-ai-plugin/
  Author:    proyecto26
  License:   MIT
  Changes:   Rebranded and rewritten to describe the design path as reached
             from this repository. The Prism theme (MIT) is inlined. GSAP is
             removed rather than bundled — it is "all rights reserved" under
             the GreenSock Standard License, and it was only performing two
             decorative entrances, which the Web Animations API does natively.
             The preview is self-contained apart from Google Fonts.

